1
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:06,370
Stilt House in Central Highlands

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:13,770
Stilt house is usually made of durable and strong wood.

3
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:37,890
It must be high so elephants can pass without touching floor and when gong and drum on floor, roof pillar doesn't catch roof.

4
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:58,280
Front compartment of stilt house is village spirit worship place, on wall hangs a basket containing sacred stone.

5
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:17,320
That is the stone village elder picked when choosing land to establish village.

6
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:50,340
Around sacred stone, people hang flower branches woven from bamboo, weapons, farming tools passed down by ancestors, and gongs drums used during worship.

7
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:59,500
Middle compartment with kitchen fire is center of stilt house.

8
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:10,530
Village elders often meet here to discuss important matters.

9
00:02:11,210 --> 00:02:16,980
This is also village guest reception place.

10
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:25,050
Third compartment is sleeping place of youth.

11
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:42,450
According to custom of many ethnic groups, village boys from 16 years old not yet married all sleep together at stilt house to protect village.

